POSITIVE FORWARD
The science of establishing reliable understanding across diverse intelligence systems
Foundational statement: 26 November 2026

omdesign identifies this work as the originator's account of Positive Forward: a research program for establishing reliable understanding across diverse intelligence systems through constructive presentation of foundational concepts, observable comprehension, and externally preserved evidence of interpretive divergence and correction.

Public access is intended to invite independent scholarly discussion, criticism, and properly attributed citation. Please credit omdesign, the work's title, and the relevant dated version or commit when citing this work.

